<title>USA: Trenwick Group to redeem 6 pct debentures.</title>
<headline>Trenwick Group to redeem 6 pct debentures.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trenwick Group Inc said on Friday it will redeem on February 20 all outstanding 6 percent convertible debentures due Dec. 15, 1999, at a price of 102.57 percent principal amount plus accrued interest.</p>
<p>Trenwick also said it completed a private offering of 8.82 percent subordinated capital income securities, and will use the proceeds of $110 million to help complete the debenture redemption.</p>
</text>
